  "analysis": "Created the handoff note. Now I need to verify all files were created correctly and update the task-routing-rules.md to include sap-helper information.",
  "plan": "1. Verify the created files exist and have correct content\n2. Update task-routing-rules.md to include sap-helper in the routing notes\n3. List all files in references directory to confirm completion",
